[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ar:Louis G.Alexander]
[ti:107. It's Too Small]
[by:Generated by iChochy]

[00:00.672]Lesson 107. | 第107课。
[00:03.742]Do you like this dress /dres/, madam? | 您喜欢这件衣服吗，太太？
[00:06.632]I like the colour very much. | 我非常喜欢这个颜色。
[00:09.582]It's a lovely dress /dres/, but it's too small for me. | 这是一件可爱的连衣裙，但它对我来说太小了。
[00:15.322]What about this one? | 这件怎么样？
[00:17.332]It's a lovely dress /dres/. | 这是一件可爱的连衣裙。
[00:19.532]It's very smart. | 它很时尚。
[00:21.502]Short skirts are in fashion now. | 现在流行短裙。
[00:24.362]Would you like to try it? | 您想试试吗？
[00:26.502]All right. | 好的。
[00:29.802]I'm afraid this green dress /dres/ is too small for me as well. | 恐怕这件绿色连衣裙对我来说也太小了。
[00:34.332]It's smaller than the blue one. | 它比蓝色的那件还小。
[00:39.142]I don't like the colour either. | 我也不喜欢这个颜色。
[00:41.532]It doesn't suit /suːt/ me at all. | 它一点也不适合我。
[00:44.272]I think the blue dress /dres/ is prettier /ˈprɪtiə/. | 我认为蓝色的连衣裙更漂亮。
[00:49.262]Could you show me another blue dress /dres/? | 能给我看看另一件蓝色连衣裙吗？
[00:52.262]I want a dress /dres/ like that one, but it must be my size. | 我想要一件像那样的连衣裙，但它必须是我的尺码。
[00:58.072]I'm afraid I haven't got a larger /ˈlɑːdʒə/ dress /dres/. | 恐怕我没有更大的连衣裙了。
[01:01.832]This is the largest /ˈlɑːdʒɪst/ dress /dres/ in the shop. | 这是店里最大的连衣裙了。
